{#
private-apps.njk — Rob's private launchpad (spec: Nov 1, 2026).
- UNLINKED: no nav entry, no index listing, excluded from all collections,
  `noindex,nofollow` via base.njk. Reachable only by its direct path.
- `sitemap: false` is a guard for any future sitemap template: skip pages with it.
- Unlinked is NOT access control: this page is public static HTML on GitHub Pages.
  Each app enforces its own access (tailnet and/or its own sign-in).
- Launch links only. NEVER add any password, passphrase, token or credential here
  or in src/_data/apps.json.
- Data: src/_data/apps.json (same source as the public showcase).
- Serendipity line: src/_data/serendipity.json, one per day via the dailyPick filter.
#}
<section class="py-16 bg-gray-900 min-h-screen">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Launchpad</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Launch links for Rob's apps. Each app handles its own access.</p>
    {% set serendipityLine = serendipity.lines | dailyPick %}
    {% if serendipityLine %}<p class="serendipity text-wavgen-yellow/80 text-sm italic mb-8">✦ {{ serendipityLine }}</p>{% else %}<div class="mb-8"></div>{% endif %}

    <ul class="space-y-3">
      {% for app in apps.items %}
      <li class="bg-gray-800 border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3" data-app-id="{{ app.id }}">
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="text-white font-semibold">{{ app.name }}</p>
          {% if app.access %}<p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">{{ app.access }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if app.launchUrl %}
        <a href="{{ app.launchUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-wavgen-yellow text-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-sm font-medium hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-colors">Launch →</a>
        {% else %}
        <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Launch URL not set</span>
        {% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
